    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a trait storing values in a cell for individual-based simulations. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class extends the <ref refid="class_trait" kindref="compound">Trait</ref> base class and includes functionality to:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Generate multiple traits from configuration.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Retrieve trait identifiers.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Handle JSON configuration and serialization. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
